  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>在这个模组中发现古董贸易船！</p>\n<p>在船上，你还会遇到准备与你交易的村民。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/316/front-view.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/317/side-view.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p>这艘宏伟的船只生成于Minecraft的所有海洋中，装满了宝藏和神秘的战利品。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">YouTube模组展示：</span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:400px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W55RbgUpsdI?t=13s\" width=\"309\" height=\"258\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>欢迎在你的整合包中使用此模组！</p>\n</div>",
